WEBVTT

00:00:03.335 --> 00:00:06.670
Hi there! I own this vine. Harvest away, seriously, go nuts.

00:00:12.506 --> 00:00:15.008
Why is it still going. We picked three bananas.

00:00:17.509 --> 00:00:20.010
I can infer that we are not harvesting the vine. The vine is harvesting us.

00:00:22.511 --> 00:00:25.012
Between us, we rent this tree too. From the cloud above the cloud.

00:00:25.013 --> 00:00:27.514
Enough harvesting. Let's plant. Our yard, no landlord.

